                    "patching_rect": [ 506.36361825466156, 32.72727155685425, 705.0, 193.0 ],
                    "text": "receives led values as [ i i i ] on each led-n-buf where n is the led index (1-30)\n\nvalues are held in a buffer until a bang is sent to *led-SCL-pulse* to send them out of the outlet. This will format the values such that:\n\n/led/set/state [ R, G, B, .... ]\n\nWhere /led/set/state contains a blob of 3 * n (n = number of leds) bytes (R, G, B for each led)"
                }
            },
